From 8ad3d57847d277893b0dceabcf2b46b41235e614 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Blumenstingl <martin.blumenstingl@googlemail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2020 22:03:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 77/98] dt-bindings: usb: Add binding for Etron
 EJ168/EJ188/EJ198

Etron EJ168/EJ188/EJ198 are USB xHCI host controllers which embed a GPIO
controller.

