+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/usb/etron,ej1x8.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: EJ168/EJ188/EJ198 xHCI controllers with four GPIO lines
+
+maintainers:
